docs-check	Boundary-unit naming ratchet	2026-09-22T12:58:24.4242855Z hdl/ieee1722/crf/KL_media_nco.sv:KL_media_nco: servo_trim_i — documented in ppm, not named for it: --- the servo path ----------------------------------------------------- KL_mmcm_drp_servo's u, signed, in 1/16 ppm units (its A_MCSRV_STAT [31:16] field). Lives HERE rather than in the datapath so the sign and the rescale are covered by this module's suite: a sign error between the two conventions is a runaway servo, not a wrong number, and four naked lines in a 5000-line wrapper had no way to be exercised.
